Error [jet.ReservedPackedLayout]: `align` requires one integer byte value or `build.cpu.cache_line` (or `target, N`)
  --> tests/ui/layout_align_not_bytes.jet:1:18
    |
  1 | #Layout(c, align(line))
    |                  ^^^^
 Why: `#Layout(c, align(N))` is compiler-owned ABI metadata
 Fix: Write `align(64)`, `align(build.cpu.cache_line)` or `align(target, 2097152)`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1105
